{"id":"wb-4-147","name":"太昊陵庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太昊陵庙","text":"太昊陵庙位于中华人民共和国河南省周口市淮阳区淮宁街道，是太昊伏羲氏的陵庙，第四批全国重点文物保护单位。太昊陵庙有明确记载的历史沿革可追溯至唐宋时期，明、清两代经过多次重建和扩修，逐渐形成现有的建筑格局，现存古建筑即明清时期的遗存。\n太昊陵庙在历史上长期承担官方和民间祭祀伏羲的功能，尤其以农历二月举行的庙会影响较大，是中原地区重要的伏羲文化纪念和民间祭祀场所。以太昊陵庙为主要景点的太昊伏羲陵文化旅游区为国家5A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E6%98%8A%E9%99%B5%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94957827,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94957827","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/92825f0263652809d7d5ac86.jpg","title":"20260913_Tomb_and_Temple_of_Taihao_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260913_Tomb_and_Temple_of_Taihao_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/20260913_Tomb_and_Temple_of_Taihao_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南淮阳 太昊陵庙 午朝门","width":320,"height":213}}